{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness","id":366018,"title":"So...Sex in the World of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-10T21:31:50-08:00","id":366018,"title":"So...Sex in the World of Darkness","content":"Ok... i was watching the last video of Counter Monkey (( <a href=\"http://spoonyexperiment.com/counter-monkey/counter-monkey-the-dirtiest-book-in-the-game-part-1/\" target=\"_blank\">http://spoonyexperiment.com/counter-...e-game-part-1/</a> )) and i was thinking, how you guys handle Sex in games? do you go through the full scene making the players do Rolls, how important its in your games? do you just go<br /> ST: yeah, ok you guys have sex, ok.. (looks at the other players and ignores what just happend and keeps running the game to the rest of the guys, returns to the other players who were having sex in game) ok, so you smoke your cigarrette afterwards...<br /> <br /> im not talking about dark scenes involving things like Rape, no no no. i just mean, how you ST or do scenes involving sex or sexual intercouse between characters?<br /> <br /> PS: if a mod wishes to erase the thread ill totally understand it, just dont ban me !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":1754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","user":"Crowley","date":".  dropping a PS , i dont wanna get banned 01-11-2015, 12:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T22:20:46-08:00","id":366065,"title":"","content":"I usually opt for fade-to-black in my games, but the last <i>Changeling: the Lost</i> chronicle I was in had some explicit sex scenes, as all involved parties were comfortable with that.<br /> <br /> Never use rolls for sex scenes. That's just tacky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T22:30:30-08:00","id":366072,"title":"","content":"Generally in my experience the Fade to Black is the default for sex scenes. Or the ST will say something like <b>&quot;Well while they are all getting smexy in that room over there, the rest of the party will be...&quot;</b> It's rarely necessary to say more than that, unless there is some reason the ST has sex in the game and if an ST does go there, usually it's never a <i>Good</i> thing. <b>&quot;So you're doing this insanely sexy woman and she keeps moaning how she wants you... then CHOMP! her Vag has eaten your genitals.&quot; </b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T23:21:09-08:00","id":366092,"title":"","content":"Are we talking LARP or tabletop?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T06:22:16-08:00","id":366230,"title":"","content":"As we usually play Vampire, usually sex is made &quot;off-screen&quot;...<br /> like<br /> &quot;yeah, you did it&quot;<br /> &quot;oh, wonderful...&quot;<br /> <br /> the rolls the players do are all related to their personal approach to the act, for example, if such act influenced the character's Humanity, if he/she frenzied for low Humanity and Vitae and tried to drain his/her lover, and so on","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0