st\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are we talking LARP or tabletop?</div> </div> </div> </div>ok, on larp id imagine it would be a bit akward to handle but.. got any experiences on this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T07:54:15-08:00","id":366277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=366276#post366276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ok, on larp id imagine it would be a bit akward to handle but.. got any experiences on this?</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't a huge part of the LARP scene completely dependent upon people hooking up through this method?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T01:56:18-08:00","id":367137,"title":"","content":"Normally, we use the &quot;fade to black&quot; option in my group when comes to roleplaying the specifics.<br /> <br /> A roll will be made if the sex was specifically trying to accomplish a story important goal for a character. For example, I had a character once who was trying to gain information and social favor from an NPC. She allowed herself to be seduced, and faked being affected by a roofie-like drug she resistant to in order to accomplish this. I made a Stamina check against the drug, succeeded, then narrated that my character was willing giving herself over. I rolled something like Dex + Subterfuge (or Performance, can't recall) to determine how well the character was able to accomplish her broader social goals via the (&quot;off camera&quot;) sex scene.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T06:58:04-08:00","id":367326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=366277#post366277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Isn't a huge part of the LARP scene completely dependent upon people hooking up through this method?</div> </div> </div> </div>...Nope...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T08:33:33-08:00","id":367391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=366277#post366277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Isn't a huge part of the LARP scene completely dependent upon people hooking up through this method?</div> </div> </div> </div>If it is, then I failed the entire 5 years I was in a LARP. Never got any from a fellow troupe member.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T23:19:04-08:00","id":371983,"title":"","content":"I do all the sex scenes as fade to black unless something can be learned from not doing so, and those are normally for letting players notice tattoos and stuff of importance.<br /> <br /> I have a character who a damn harem of girls and goes around sleeping with vampires and humans alike. Sometimes alone, sometimes with his Toreador wife, and sometimes as his wife. I think he's slept with at least 15 girls throughout the game. 50% of Clan Toreador is at his beck and call, along with the Ventrue Primogen, the Lasombra Primogen, and possibly Malkavian Primogen.<br /> <br /> I guess that's what you get for making your character a 1920's millionaire playboy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T09:23:14-08:00","id":372600,"title":"","content":"It has definitely come up in Mage games when there are people playing Cult of Ecstasy characters. We usually do &quot;fade to black&quot; or the classic B&amp;W movie trope of &quot;camera moves to the blowing curtains, fade out&quot;. It does short-change those characters though; we are HEAVY into describing exactly how each character makes his or her paradigm work to generate the effect they're looking for. We don't &quot;fade to black&quot; while describing the Dreamspeakers drum up the spirits, Hermetics draw out the sigils and intone the incantations, the Etherites finagle up a new gadget for this application or the NWO agent puts down a small gadget and begins to articulate his arguments just so.... There is a little leeway - like setting up the outlines of what exactly this sex scene will involve in the way of participants and/or props.... but that's it. No description of what this roll of the dice means in the way of accomplishing their objectives (or not, in the case of Paradox, failure, backlash, whatever....) just a laundry list of what they got out of it after the fact. <br /> <br /> But I have no inclination to do it any other way. I was in a Skype game (not with my long time crew of players) where the descriptions of the sex got a little vivid in a rock concert that turned into an orgy scene. It was entirely appropriate story-wise. My character was the performer, so he wasn't involved in the shenanigans, but family members overheard what everyone else was up to and people were getting upset. I was also uncomfortable myself as I knew that another player was taking care of his young nephew. <br /> <br /> In the next M20 game, if the player of a CoE wants the &quot;full immersion&quot; description that everyone else is getting, they are probably going to have to focus on other aspects of that Tradition's foci, like inebriation, drug use or other activities that lead to an ecstatic state. (For an example on the weirder end, there was an very powerful NPC Cultist who was a gourmand and was blissing out over the pate. If you REALLY wanted taccess to high level Time effects, you had to arrange to meet him for a full course formal dinner...)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T14:10:00-08:00","id":373758,"title":"","content":"I larp online and record it on my youtube channel. No way are we doing explicit scenes. Really, as a Changeling ST, I could see wanting to know vague details if there was a possibility of pregnancy. Other than that I treat it like eating or going to the bathroom: no gonna narrate that stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T20:11:52-08:00","id":376874,"title":"","content":"in my hunter game we did some pregnancy and had major significance to one of my players, an experience i keep torturing her with :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T09:35:32-08:00","id":377279,"title":"","content":"We've dealt with issues of pregnancy and raising young (and Awakened) children. (&quot;Patrick! Use your words. You can't talk mind to mind with everyone you meet. It's dangerous for you and upsets them.&quot;) All issues of sex happened off-camera and very abstractly, even though magic was involved. (The mother was a Cultist using Life to NOT get pregnant. and the father a Euthanatos with Life and Entropy who wanted the child. As did the universe as a whole seemingly. He had certain messiah-like traits. Including the early death part, which his mother foresaw with Time. Ahhhh! The pathos!) Come to think of it, we had another child conceived and born between the PC father and NPC mother, as well and a character who came out and started a relationship with his consor after a lot of cat and mouse games while they both struggled with it. (They were the same character, but he got split up, then re-integrated.... )<br /> <br /> Somehow, even with all those sex-related topics, we never ever were explicit or graphic in how we dealt with the issues. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T07:49:52-08:00","id":378052,"title":"","content":"My current tactic is to avoid mentioning to my players that vampires can have sex. Considering how surprised they were at the fact that most vampires cannot eat food (which the Tremere keeps forgetting, and has recently discovered that I extend this to water) I wouldn't be surprised if they only realise it after a dhampyr appears (I've decided that a young member of the Malkavian's gang is one, with potence and celerity) for them to work out where they come from.<br /> <br /> If anyone of them does try it though, I'll just use the &quot;fade to black and lose blush of health+1 blood points approach&quot;. It's simple and if they desperately need to roleplay it I can do so when it isn't going to hold the entire group up. (Which will consist of me going &quot;no, that's just creepy&quot; over and over until they let up.)<br /> <br /> But I don't expect maturity on the subject from them, the Lasombra's tentacles make them giggle. The only subject they can't be mature about it seems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":4507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","user":"TwoDSix","date":". 01-23-2015, 05:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T11:07:05-08:00","id":378217,"title":"","content":"My RP circle is not against smut, so it happens. Even if sometimes it's awkward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T01:11:45-08:00","id":388127,"title":"","content":"1) VtM.<br /> <br /> Lets just say that thanks to my players yet another euphemism have entered our &quot;Devil's Dictionary for WoD&quot;:<br /> <br /> <i>Spend Blood Points in Humanity</i> - spend some precious BPs to revive your &quot;bodily functions&quot; right before having an intercourse.<br /> <br /> 2) VDA.<br /> <br /> a) Sodomy. Lots of sodomy, actually. I... I'm really not sure if this forum rules allow me to go into details.<br /> b) As far as I know there is no scientifically approved term for a &quot;noble Lasombra <i>don</i> having a wild late night with Nosferatu's female&quot;.<br /> c) Ye Goode and Olde Cittiye of York <i>lupanarium</i> extends its thanks and salutations to PCs and ask them to visit them again.<br /> <br /> 3) WtA.<br /> <br /> Homid Ragabash Silent Strider: &quot;Hey-hey-hey, here! It wasn't Litany's breach with this Silver Fang's girl! We used condoms! Everything is allright! Uhm, right?&quot;<br /> <br /> 4) (Modified) Project Twillight.<br /> <br /> My character proved once again that, despite what some detractors might say, <i><b>there was sex in the USSR</b></i>.<br /> <br /> As for methods - nothing too graphic (or disturbing). But should my players go with something interesting, like Hermetic's Flambeau and Taftani creating an intertvining fire patterns as a prelude, which grew bigger and comlicated as they preogress and use them as metpahor of their sex - sure, I'm in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","user":"von Lyttenburgh","date":". 02-25-2015, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T09:18:11-08:00","id":388489,"title":"","content":"Graphic for VtM or VDA? How can you get more graphic than anything involving Tzimisce?<br /> <br /> Of course, Briam Lumley goes there full on 100% (though that makes since, since his vampires seem the core concept for the Tzimisce)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1062,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","user":"Ajax","date":". 02-02-2015, 12:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T14:48:53-08:00","id":388965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=388489#post388489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Graphic for VtM or VDA? How can you get more graphic than anything involving Tzimisce?<br /> <br /> Of course, Briam Lumley goes there full on 100% (though that makes since, since hi vampires seem the core concept for the Tzimisce)</div> </div> </div> </div>In the same way that the cover of DMC3 is the &quot;core concept&quot; of the Aegis Kai Doru splat picture in Hunter; the Vigil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T09:10:19-08:00","id":389925,"title":"","content":"Aaaargh! I never saw that before... how the hell did that even get past an editor!?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T09:19:31-08:00","id":389935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=389925#post389925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aaaargh! I never saw that before... how the hell did that even get past an editor!?</div> </div> </div> </div>Vigil was made back when WW was still doing the supplement treadmill, so there would have been pretty much no spare time on the schedule for re-doing things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T18:39:41-08:00","id":412293,"title":"","content":"I've found with the Spiral game i'm doing that sex becomes a thing. We tend to avoid the more graphic details and more lead into problems inherent. Examples include hunting her particular prey for the evening, and how do you deal with having rams horns on your head? So while the act itself is more just &quot;you're doing it, moving on&quot; the subtler problems become rp points. &gt;&gt; Hiding bodies becomes another issue entirely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T09:19:44-08:00","id":421865,"title":"","content":"Per a number of other people's responses, I do the &quot;fade to black...&quot; approach. However, on a couple occasions, the sex scenes <i>were</i> played out, in at least some reasonable detail, but that was due to narratives involved: there was something mystical going on, and therefore certain descriptors needed to be employed, and the scene needed to be set. There was also a scene that I was PC in where my character was raped (seduced, but effectively raped), and the GM and I went into another room to keep the scenes details a secret from the other players; for a level of post-harsh-scene comic relief/effect, when I came out of the room, I looked distraught, went over to another player and buried my head into her shoulder, faux-mock-weeping, leading her to hold me and look at the GM and go &quot;What did you <i>do</i>, Ray?!&quot; -- a la' Ghostbusters -- while she just hugged me. GM went: &quot;Next...&quot; in a stern, callous manner. *That* was a case of roleplaying a sex scene where &quot;fade to black...&quot; would have wasted an opportunity for both a serious in-character shift (my character was enthralled with the demon who had seduced her -- said demon being the mother of the other PC in cited, resulting in myriad complications) as well as a wonderful bit of meta-narrative humor.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, fading is the way to go...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T16:58:05-08:00","id":424671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness#post366018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... and i was thinking, how you guys handle Sex in games?</div> </div> </div> </div>The only time it came up was after my character had irritated his npc partner by being overprotective. The scene described, with a little more than innuendo, the make-up attempt wherein the partner got what she wanted and then left him hanging by leaving to go &quot;shopping&quot;. However, there was no 'blow by blow' description of the sporting event.<br /> <br /> Frankly, it simply depends on how important the event is to the story. Certainly a Cult of Xtc story may end up more descriptive in that way. Also, it may not be necessary to waste game time with something that can be embellished in the character or game journal later.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=366065#post366065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Never use rolls for sex scenes. That's just tacky.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know. There is just something worth remembering about that time you got 24 successes off of 7 die through 10 again. And that still wouldn't match an Epic Fail or in the old system - a botch roll of 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 3, and 6.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cIt was clear to me for a long time that the origins of science had their deep roots in a particular myth, that of invariance.&quot; ~ Giorgio de Santillana<br /> Preface to Hamlet's Mill","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2345-whithers","name":"Whithers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2345_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T11:34:39-08:00","id":426742,"title":"","content":"&quot;You rolled a quintuple botch? Remember that scene in John Carpenter's <i>The Thing</i> where Norris' head tears loose, drops to the floor, and grows eyestalks and spider legs? Yeah, in retrospect using Vicissitude to up your game may not have been the best idea.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T10:10:47-07:00","id":940671,"title":"","content":"This reminds me of my ST for our Vampire game whose rule is that only Toreador are able to have sex and enjoy sex and can create ghouls that way. I think he read that somewhere, but I'll have to ask.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T23:50:23-07:00","id":941072,"title":"","content":"Is not a canon thing in VtM sufficed to say; whether Toreador, Setite, Tzimisce, Nosferatu or any other Clan or Bloodline out there, all Kindred can have sex if they really want to. Enjoying it is another thing, but I digress. I do think though that as a general stereotype, the Toreador are the more likely of Clans to engage in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T02:51:25-07:00","id":941114,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is not a canon thing in VtM sufficed to say; whether Toreador, Setite, Tzimisce, Nosferatu or any other Clan or Bloodline out there, all Kindred can have sex if they really want to. Enjoying it is another thing, but I digress. </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yaoi Huntress Earth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=940671#post940671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This reminds me of my ST for our Vampire game whose rule is that only Toreador are able to have sex and enjoy sex and can create ghouls that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically according to V20, only Vampires with Humanity can do it, as they are the only ones capable of giving themselves the illusion of life. By spending 8-humanity blood for a scene. Vampires that are on a Path can't. And while those with Humanity can do it, it's a weak, pale thing compared to the kiss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T06:03:35-07:00","id":941147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=941114#post941114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Technically according to V20, only Vampires with Humanity can do it, as they are the only ones capable of giving themselves the illusion of life. By spending 8-humanity blood for a scene. Vampires that are on a Path can't. And while those with Humanity can do it, it's a weak, pale thing compared to the kiss.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm surprised the ones on more hedonistic paths can't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T08:16:38-07:00","id":941202,"title":"","content":"Yes, you would think the Path of Ecstasy would be able to do it. In my games, sex is magnified when it is done with a major supernatural. In the case of a vampire, the effect is multiplied by the Humanity of the vampire. In the case of werewolves, it is magnified by the Gnosis of the werewolf. In the case of changelings, it is magnified by their Glamour. In the case of mages, it is magnified bt their Arete. In the case of wraiths, it is magnified by their current Pathos. Sexual pleasure for your partner is also a Manipulation plus Empathy roll, so vampires without Humanity just do it wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","user":"Aya Tari","date":". 08-01-2016, 11:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T16:03:39-07:00","id":941469,"title":"","content":"Sex is a big part of the games but I generally don't describe it. The atmosphere and importance of sex to Kindred is big in my games, though. Vampires have a lot of causal, meaningless sex as the Kiss causes humans to orgasm if they're in a sensual mood and is better than regular sex for vampires. Herds also tend to include causal girlfriends and boyfriends plus people they outright keep as toys. Ghouls tend to act like slavish concubines if they're attracted to their masters and the Blood Bond can be used as a substitute for love. I use sex as a a tool for my vampires and a way they manipulate, discard, and abuse humans as well as each other.<br /> <br /> It's also a perk of being a vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T09:20:40-07:00","id":944887,"title":"","content":"Sex happens off-screen with me. I have played my fair shair of characters who have sex, but the foremost was Sachiel, my bisexual Defiler in a game of Demon: The Fallen. One of his Thralls was a woman he seduced as part of seducing her into a Pact. During the game Sachiel more or less coerced her into committing industrial espionage on her employee, giving him a list of names and addresses of a Ventrue's Ghouls so that we could track them down, offer to free them of their Ghouldom. She started to doubt her relationship and status as a Thrall, which only increased the more and more Sachiel coerced her into doing things like interrogating her boss, leaking confidential documents and even theft.<br /> <br /> This came to a head where we managed to lure the Ventrue onto a yacht and killed him (he got set on fire, then jumped into the water where our Devourer in the guise of a shark, well, devoured him). She confronted Sachiel and demanded to be released of her Thralldom. Given that he had given her Gifts that made her immune to mind control and her social stats were buffed through the roof, Sachiel had to either agree with all risks that came with it, or don't and have those risks come up.<br /> <br /> So he released her of their contract and had the group's Devil wipe her mind, making her think that their thing was just a fling that didn't work out instead of a rather intense relationship. One of my best roleplaying experiences to this date.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T10:11:30-07:00","id":944924,"title":"","content":"There are reasons why I change the canon to prevent Demons from existing in any meaningful numbers...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T10:43:46-07:00","id":944940,"title":"","content":"Sex is a fade to black thing in games I'm involved in. My stance is that there's plenty of ways to get it out in the real world if you're interested and there's plenty of ways to get it on the internet if you're interested. If you want to take up a large chunk of time that I and everyone else have set aside to pretend to be vampires/wizards/changelings/werewolves/whatevers to explore every bump and grind and all the other turgid details involved in sex, then you aren't respecting my time. If the whole table wants to do that, then I'd just excuse myself because that isn't what I signed up for. Games where the tzimisce player fleshsculpt themselves a dozen dicks and vaginas that replace their ghouls' mouths or where Gangrel grow animal genitalia during frenzy or where the Malkavian's form of madness is sexual addiction just really aren't my kind of games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T11:48:54-07:00","id":944975,"title":"","content":"I have to agree with that. Fade to black is just a form of courtesy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T12:53:10-07:00","id":945011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=944924#post944924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are reasons why I change the canon to prevent Demons from existing in any meaningful numbers...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, their endgame is to radically change humanity by uplifting/enslaving/killing it. The only other splat in cWoD that wants to do something this drastic, what, the Mages? But they're too busy fighting each other to get stuff done. The Sabbat want to change things too but are kept in check by the Camarilla. And maybe some Changelings too?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T23:33:58-07:00","id":945317,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7195_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7195\" data-vbnamecard=\"7195\">TidyGamer</a>, there is a whole lot between fade to black and play-by-play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T09:33:15-07:00","id":945497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=945011#post945011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, their endgame is to radically change humanity by uplifting/enslaving/killing it. The only other splat in cWoD that wants to do something this drastic, what, the Mages? But they're too busy fighting each other to get stuff done. The Sabbat want to change things too but are kept in check by the Camarilla. And maybe some Changelings too?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the Demon endgame of opening the Gates of Hell is not one I am comfortable playing with. It is not like they even have a choice, the Lords of Hell bound them by their True Names. They have as much chance resisting their bindings as a mortal has flying by jumping out of a plane and flapping their arms really hard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T11:07:32-07:00","id":945555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=945497#post945497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, the Demon endgame of opening the Gates of Hell is not one I am comfortable playing with. It is not like they even have a choice, the Lords of Hell bound them by their True Names. They have as much chance resisting their bindings as a mortal has flying by jumping out of a plane and flapping their arms really hard.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure if it's <i>that</i> explicit. Even if this is not the case and the Demons are not aiming for a world war between the various factions and the Earthbound, casting down the Earthbound without turning the world to crap and uplifting humanity to the full potential it has funtdamentally changes how the World of Darkness works, and likely sees the extermination of most of the other supernaturals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T13:09:05-07:00","id":945614,"title":"","content":"I feel like being a prude with sex has no fucking point to it. If you can describe yourself lavishly decorating the floor with human intestines and clawing someone's skull open, the act of procreation isn't so bad. Sex isn't worse than murder. <br /> <br /> Sex in world of darkness is interesting to. I'm not just talking about the thousand tzmisce vaginas or whatever that formori is packing. I'm talking about perversion of the natural order. Toreador Casanovas using it to feed. Giovanni defiling corpses, Sabbat in a blood orgy, or whatever monsterous thing the BSD and Nephandi are doing to children. I think if you can have a gorefest, you can put sex into a world that asks for it. Making that player uncomfortable for using the garou eye-rape when his target throws herself into it. Showing the power of the toreador prince, as she surrounds herself with toyboys. The game is personal horror. Sex can be unsettling, especially when you're insecure, but that makes it a tool; not a taboo. So long as it doesn't read like a fanflick or the storyteller's repressed fantasies, it's good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7244-innocent-flower","name":"Innocent Flower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7244_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T13:22:54-07:00","id":945622,"title":"","content":"Sex is always interesting, but I am not, as an ST, interested in gaming out the perverted desires of any player who wants to try to do things that are so depraved that you cannot even find them on the internet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T14:50:17-07:00","id":945681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/366018-so-sex-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=945622#post945622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">are so depraved that you cannot even find them on the internet.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's...there's a lot you can find on the internet.<br /> <br /> *runs away","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T14:54:11-07:00","id":945685,"title":"","content":"Yes, I know, but the reason why I fade to black nowadays is I had players in the 90s that deliberately did sexual acts in game that they could not find on the internet. Nowadays, who knows?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T14:54:11-07:00","id":945686,"title":"","content":"On the one hand I agree with Innocent Flower that it should be there and not shyed away from as it is as much a part of the world as murder or take-away food; but on the other I'm also with Aya Tari in that I don't have any vested interest in ERPing and spend the next 30-60+ minutes talking about how someone moans because they're getting fingers and/or other things shoved up where the sun doesn't shine; especially not if it involves gay sex since I find the mental imagery (as a straight man) very unpleasant. I'm of the same mind when it comes to torture and the sort if it doesn't serve any practical purpose and is only done For The Evulz.<br /> Should it be a thing in the world? In my opinion, yes. Should it be an option to indulge it? Yes; I believe so. Does it have to played out in detail? I think we can do without; fade-to-black does perfectly well to cover what we know is happening anyway and if the player wanna do something very specific during it that somehow affects the game from there they can merely note it before we fade back in. Otherwise if one really insists on going full ERP, said player should talk it out with the ST and come to an agreement on the matter, but for my part I'd rather not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T17:18:23-07:00","id":945758,"title":"","content":"No one should be held hostage at the game table and forced to participate in a porno or in graphic depictions of violence. Not the ST as a participant or the other players as witnesses. If someone is wanting to deflower a guard dog in scene and the entire table isn't on board with it, then the ST should decide between saying &quot;Frank's character wanders off with the dog and a jar of peanut butter and out of the scene&quot; and then dealing with it later so the game isn't derailed or saying &quot;no, Frank you need to grow up&quot; and dealing with it right then. Same as if Frank wants to describe how he dismembers a body and hurls the pieces with enough force to make them explode into chunky salsa, or if he wants to shove a stick of dynamite down a ghoul's throat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T17:37:50-07:00","id":945768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>A