nk-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T06:11:28-07:00","id":949999,"title":"","content":"To be fair like half of the game lines in cWoD have weird sex shit going on:<br /> <br /> - Werewolf can have humans knock up wolves and vice versa, there's all sorts of weird stuff with the Fomori and of course all the other breeds that you could theoretically have sex with.<br /> - Vampires are inherently sexual creatures, but with increased amounts of bloodplay. Then of course there's Uncle Tzimisce Maximum Vicissitude Fun Times, Gangrel turning into part animal and the Toreador generally having sex with everything.<br /> - Mages have the option to base their entire Focus around sex, sexuality, sensuality and physical contact. And if you know what you're doing you can use your Spheres to do all sorts of weird sex stuff.<br /> - Changeling has the Satyrs, whom the other Kiths describe with variants of &quot;Stop having so much sex!&quot;<br /> - Demons have the Defilers, who are even more about tempting than the other Houses are, and their powers make seducing people very easy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T07:06:33-07:00","id":950013,"title":"","content":"And the entire Arcanoi of Embody builds up to the point of being a secret ghostly lover at the 5th level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar"